Notes / gotchas
---------------
- HDOS 2.0 detects the console's baud rate at boot: it puts the 8250 in
  loopback, then tries 2400 baud and 9600 in turn until a SPACE arrives
  cleanly. Press SPACE (twice: the first goes to the 2400 attempt).
- The H17D draft's sector status is one byte in the published images, four
  in the draft's text; both are read.
- A 204800-byte H8D is DS40 unless hinted SS80: nothing in the file says.
